✅ MENTAL MODELS (Very important)
🔹 Trie is just:

"Multi-level HashMap of characters"

You are NOT memorizing nodes — you’re storing prefixes.

🔹 Binary Trie:

"Bit-by-bit tree that branches on 0 and 1"

🔹 DP on strings:

"Index-by-index decisions — keep or skip"

